{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1773071644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras_big/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1773071644 width=800 height=148 /></span>In the near future, humanity is steadily expanding into the depths of space. You are an astronaut on a routine but important mission: follow a designated route to a remote station and deliver technical data.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/088e4f9ef2ad79b13476e4797e762a25.poster.avif?t=1773071644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/088e4f9ef2ad79b13476e4797e762a25.webm?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/088e4f9ef2ad79b13476e4797e762a25.mp4?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Along the way, command contacts you with an additional request \u2014 retrieve documents from the research vessel <strong>&quot;Echo-7&quot;</strong>, which recently went silent. The silence is attributed to a recent geomagnetic storm disrupting communications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/7e2823c3f8435f3413375b17c3dba792.poster.avif?t=1773071644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/7e2823c3f8435f3413375b17c3dba792.webm?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/7e2823c3f8435f3413375b17c3dba792.mp4?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you approach Echo-7, you attempt to contact the crew \u2014 but there\u2019s no response. The ship appears functional from the outside. Inside \u2014 nothing. <br><br>No welcoming party, no signs of life. Just empty corridors, scattered personal belongings, and the unsettling feeling that you're not alone.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Realistic graphics</strong> \u2014 visual fidelity enhances the feeling of unease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Haunting atmosphere</strong> \u2014 silence, isolation, and growing tension follow your every step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive sound</strong> \u2014 rich audio design pulls you deep into the experience</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743180?t=1773071644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3743180?t=1773071644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/0050e36edf1b741078c96f4d5993664fb9c21a2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773071644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/0050e36edf1b741078c96f4d5993664fb9c21a2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773071644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\u26a0\ufe0f Health Warning\r\nCertain visual effects in Dire Echo, including flashing lights, rapid screen transitions, and high-contrast scenes, may trigger epileptic seizures or headaches in sensitive individuals.\r\n\r\nIf you experience dizziness, nausea, blurred vision, muscle twitching, or disorientation, stop playing immediately and consult a doctor."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4171580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1773071644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras_big/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1773071644 width=800 height=148 /></span>In the near future, humanity is steadily expanding into the depths of space. You are an astronaut on a routine but important mission: follow a designated route to a remote station and deliver technical data.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/088e4f9ef2ad79b13476e4797e762a25.poster.avif?t=1773071644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/088e4f9ef2ad79b13476e4797e762a25.webm?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/088e4f9ef2ad79b13476e4797e762a25.mp4?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Along the way, command contacts you with an additional request \u2014 retrieve documents from the research vessel <strong>&quot;Echo-7&quot;</strong>, which recently went silent. The silence is attributed to a recent geomagnetic storm disrupting communications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/7e2823c3f8435f3413375b17c3dba792.poster.avif?t=1773071644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/7e2823c3f8435f3413375b17c3dba792.webm?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/7e2823c3f8435f3413375b17c3dba792.mp4?t=1773071644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you approach Echo-7, you attempt to contact the crew \u2014 but there\u2019s no response. The ship appears functional from the outside. Inside \u2014 nothing. <br><br>No welcoming party, no signs of life. Just empty corridors, scattered personal belongings, and the unsettling feeling that you're not alone.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Realistic graphics</strong> \u2014 visual fidelity enhances the feeling of unease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Haunting atmosphere</strong> \u2014 silence, isolation, and growing tension follow your every step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive sound</strong> \u2014 rich audio design pulls you deep into the experience</p>","developers":["TrueGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/05c22cf5ef7893b5dd61c756ce94e5d5ebfb3d53/header.jpg?t=1773071644","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul